                            <img  class="absolute inset-0 object-cover" src="https://img.canarymedia.com/content/uploads/Cranes-in-the-distance-from-boat-resized.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=crop&amp;fp-x=0.5&amp;fp-y=0.5&amp;h=1492&amp;q=80&amp;w=3360&amp;s=80fa1cb7ccfa7b2a0b0f7afdc6d6b54d" srcset="https://img.canarymedia.com/content/uploads/Cranes-in-the-distance-from-boat-resized.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=crop&amp;fp-x=0.5&amp;fp-y=0.5&amp;h=1492&amp;q=80&amp;w=3360&amp;s=80fa1cb7ccfa7b2a0b0f7afdc6d6b54d 3360w, https://img.canarymedia.com/content/uploads/Cranes-in-the-distance-from-boat-resized.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=crop&amp;fp-x=0.5&amp;fp-y=0.5&amp;h=746&amp;q=80&amp;w=1680&amp;s=33b127a701a62b48be35b9c2ad2afc14 1680w, https://img.canarymedia.com/content/uploads/Cranes-in-the-distance-from-boat-resized.jpg?auto=compress%2Cformat&amp;crop=focalpoint&amp;fit=crop&amp;fp-x=0.5&amp;fp-y=0.5&amp;h=373&amp;q=80&amp;w=840&amp;s=40cc99047d571b3d6f83f758d97a2737 840w" width="3360" height="1492" alt="" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy">
                                        <figcaption class="type-theta text-gray-500 mt-2.5">(Verónica Gabriela Cárdenas for Canary Media)</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                                                
